"Recognises a returning browser so a visit is counted once instead of once "
"per page."
msgstr ""
"Reconoce un navegador que vuelve, para que una visita se cuente una vez en "
"lugar de una vez por página."

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:526
msgid "30 days"
msgstr "30 días"

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:527
msgid ""
"Remembers that this visitor allowed analytics, so the choice survives the "
"next page load."
msgstr ""
"Recuerda que este visitante permitió las analíticas, para que la elección "
"sobreviva a la siguiente carga de página."

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:533 includes/brikpanel-consent.php:540
msgid "Until midnight"
msgstr "Hasta medianoche"

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:534
msgid ""
"Counts an add-to-cart once per day per visitor for the conversion funnel."
msgstr ""
"Cuenta un añadido al carrito una vez al día por visitante para el embudo de "
"conversión."

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:541
msgid ""
"Counts a checkout visit once per day per visitor for the conversion funnel."
msgstr ""
"Cuenta una visita al pago una vez al día por visitante para el embudo de "
"conversión."

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:547 includes/brikpanel-consent.php:558
msgid "Until cleared"
msgstr "Hasta que se borre"

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:548
msgid "Marks that this browser has already been counted as a visitor today."
msgstr "Marca que este navegador ya se ha contado hoy como visitante."

#: includes/brikpanel-consent.php:559
msgid ""
"Marks that this browser has already been counted as a product viewer today."
msgstr ""
"Marca que este navegador ya se ha contado hoy como visitante de producto."

#. translators: %d: number of completed orders reached (100 or 200).
#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:204
#, php-format
msgid "%d orders in. Want first access to BrikMentor?"
msgstr "%d pedidos completados. ¿Quieres acceso prioritario a BrikMentor?"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:206
msgid "Get early access to BrikMentor"
msgstr "Consigue acceso anticipado a BrikMentor"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:209
msgid ""
"We're building BrikMentor: an AI assistant that reads your store data, spots "
"what is driving (and leaking) revenue, and turns it into action, from smart "
"suggestions to email and marketing automation that reaches the right "
"customers, all inside WooCommerce. Your store now has enough data to get "
"real value from it. Join the private beta list and we'll invite you the "
"moment it opens."
msgstr ""
"Estamos creando BrikMentor: un asistente de IA que lee los datos de tu "
"tienda, detecta qué impulsa (y qué fuga) los ingresos y lo convierte en "
"acción, desde sugerencias inteligentes hasta automatización de correo y "
"marketing que llega a los clientes adecuados, todo dentro de WooCommerce. Tu "
"tienda ya tiene suficientes datos para obtener un valor real de ellos. "
"Apúntate a la lista de la beta privada y te invitaremos en cuanto se abra."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:214
msgid "Select an option"
msgstr "Selecciona una opción"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:215
msgid "None yet"
msgstr "Ninguna todavía"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:240
msgid "Your email"
msgstr "Tu correo electrónico"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:241
msgid "you@store.com"
msgstr "tu@tienda.com"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:246
msgid ""
"Email me about the BrikMentor beta and occasional BrikPanel tips. I can "
"unsubscribe at any time."
msgstr ""
"Envíame correos sobre la beta de BrikMentor y consejos ocasionales de "
"BrikPanel. Puedo darme de baja en cualquier momento."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:248
msgid "Please tick the box so we can email you the invite."
msgstr "Marca la casilla para que podamos enviarte la invitación por correo."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:251
#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:1196
#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:1211
msgid "Join the early access list"
msgstr "Apúntate a la lista de acceso anticipado"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:254
msgid "No spam. Just the beta invite and the occasional heads-up."
msgstr "Sin spam. Solo la invitación a la beta y algún aviso ocasional."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:263
msgid "You're on the list."
msgstr "Ya estás en la lista."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:264
msgid ""
"One quick question, totally optional: which email or marketing tool do you "
"use today? It helps us build the right thing."
msgstr ""
"Una pregunta rápida, totalmente opcional: ¿qué herramienta de correo o "
"marketing usas hoy? Nos ayuda a crear lo correcto."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:266
msgid "Email / marketing tool"
msgstr "Herramienta de correo / marketing"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:275
msgid "Skip"
msgstr "Omitir"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:284
msgid "Thank you."
msgstr "Gracias."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:285
msgid ""
"We'll email you the moment the BrikMentor beta opens. Thanks for helping "
"shape it."
msgstr ""
"Te escribiremos en cuanto se abra la beta de BrikMentor. Gracias por ayudar "
"a darle forma."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:294
msgid ""
"Heads up: we could not reach our server from your site (some hosts block "
"outbound connections). We saved your request and will keep trying, but to be "
"safe you can message us on WhatsApp and we'll add you to the list by hand."
msgstr ""
"Aviso: no pudimos contactar con nuestro servidor desde tu sitio (algunos "
"alojamientos bloquean las conexiones salientes). Guardamos tu solicitud y "
"seguiremos intentándolo, pero para mayor seguridad puedes escribirnos por "
"WhatsApp y te añadiremos a la lista a mano."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:297
msgid "Request access on WhatsApp"
msgstr "Solicitar acceso por WhatsApp"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:314
msgid ""
"Hello, I would like early access to BrikMentor. My email is {EMAIL} and my "
"store is {SITE}."
msgstr ""
"Hola, me gustaría tener acceso anticipado a BrikMentor. Mi correo es {EMAIL} "
"y mi tienda es {SITE}."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:690
#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:792
#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:797
msgid "BrikMentor is coming"
msgstr "BrikMentor está en camino"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:691
msgid ""
"An AI assistant that reads your store data and turns it into action, "
"including email and marketing automation. Join the early access list to try "
"it first."
msgstr ""
"Un asistente de IA que lee los datos de tu tienda y los convierte en acción, "
"incluida la automatización de correo y marketing. Apúntate a la lista de "
"acceso anticipado para probarlo antes que nadie."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:693
#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:871
msgid "Join the list"
msgstr "Apúntate a la lista"

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:793
msgid ""
"An AI assistant and email marketing engine for WooCommerce. It will chase "
"carts like these for you: a reminder first, a coupon only if that is not "
"enough. Join the private beta list to try it first."
msgstr ""
"Un asistente de IA y un motor de email marketing para WooCommerce. "
"Perseguirá carritos como estos por ti: primero un recordatorio y un cupón "
"solo si eso no basta. Apúntate a la lista de beta privada para probarlo "
"antes que nadie."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:800
#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:802
msgid ""
"An AI assistant and email marketing engine for WooCommerce. It will follow "
"up after each completed order and win back the buyers who drift away, so "
"lifetime value keeps growing. Join the private beta list to try it first."
msgstr ""
"Un asistente de IA y un motor de email marketing para WooCommerce. Hará "
"seguimiento después de cada pedido completado y recuperará a los compradores "
"que se alejan, para que el valor de vida siga creciendo. Apúntate a la lista "
"de beta privada para probarlo antes que nadie."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:803
msgid ""
"An AI assistant and email marketing engine for WooCommerce. It will read "
"these segments straight from BrikPanel and re-engage the ones you pick. Join "
"the private beta list to try it first."
msgstr ""
"Un asistente de IA y un motor de email marketing para WooCommerce. Leerá "
"estos segmentos directamente desde BrikPanel y volverá a captar a los que "
"elijas. Apúntate a la lista de beta privada para probarlo antes que nadie."

#: includes/brikpanel-early-access.php:804
msgid ""
"An AI assistant and email marketing engine for WooCommerce. It will scan "
"your customers daily and start a win-back series for anyone who has not "
"ordered in months. Join the private beta list to try it first."
